{"id":"u-87261b2c-58f6-44ca-9e3f-16421ca05755","src":"community","title":"J3-Day","author":"Jenna Adams","url":"https://www.boostcamp.app/users/zUMMcq-j3-day","desc":"This program is a simple, beginner-friendly hybrid strength and physique plan based on the GZCLP structure. It’s designed to help you get stronger, build visible muscle, and stay consistent without feeling overwhelmed.\n\nThe program follows the T1 / T2 / T3 format:\n\nT1: Main strength lift (2–3 min rest)\nT2: Secondary hypertrophy lift (90–120 sec rest)\nT3: Accessories for glutes, shoulders, arms, and back (60–90 sec rest)\n\nProgression is simple:\nHit the top of the rep range → increase weight next week.\nIf not → stay at the same weight and build reps.\n\nWorkouts use basic equipment (barbell, dumbbells, cables) and repeatable movements so anyone can follow the routine at home or in the gym.\n\nThe goal is to gain strength, grow muscle in all the right places, and build confidence with a program that’s structured, effective, and easy to stick with.","level":["Beginner","Intermediate"],"goals":["Muscle","Women's","Strength"],"equipment":["Garage Gym"],"minutes":60,"joins":0,"rate":0,"rateCount":0,"updated":"2026-03-15T02:53:28.856Z","variations":[{"name":"default","days":["Day 1","Day 2","Day 3"],"weeks":[[{"ex":[{"n":"Box Squat (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bench Press (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Kickback (Cable)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Hammer Curl (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lateral Raise (Dumbbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Hip Thrust (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":5,"x":3}]},{"n":"Lat Pulldown","sets":[{"r":8,"x":4}]},{"n":"Seated Row (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Glute Bridge (Barbell)","sets":[{"r":12,"x":3}]},{"n":"Tricep Rope Push Down (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]},{"n":"Bicep Curl (Cable)","sets":[{"r":10,"x":3}]}]},{"ex":[{"n":"Goblet Squat","sets":[{"r":5,"x":3}